@startuml SD_UC_E3_Settle_Invoice
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "App Phục vụ" as MobileUI
control "InvoiceController" as Controller
participant "InvoiceService" as Service
participant "InvoiceRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB
boundary "Web POS Quầy" as WebPOS
actor "Thu ngân" as Cashier
participant "Printer" as Printer

== Kịch bản 1: Phục vụ yêu cầu & Thu ngân in phiếu tạm tính ==

Waitstaff -> MobileUI: Chọn bàn & Bấm "Yêu cầu tính tiền"
activate MobileUI

MobileUI -> Controller: POST /api/tables/\n{tableId}/request-checkout
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: RequestCheckout(tableId)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetTableWithActiveOrder(tableId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT TableStatus, ActiveOrderId
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Table (Status = Occupied)
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: TableData
deactivate Repo

Service -> Repo: SetTablePaymentPending(tableId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: UPDATE Tables SET Status = 'PaymentPending'
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Updated
deactivate Repo

Service -> WebPOS: PushSignalR("BillRequested", tableId)
WebPOS --> Cashier: Chuông báo & Thông báo bàn yêu cầu tính tiền

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> MobileUI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

MobileUI --> Waitstaff: Đã gửi yêu cầu đến quầy thu ngân
deactivate MobileUI

Cashier -> WebPOS: Chọn bàn & Bấm "Xem tạm tính"
activate WebPOS

WebPOS -> Controller: GET /api/invoices/\npreview/{tableId}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CalculateInvoice(tableId)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetOrderAndDeposit(tableId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT ServedItems & Deposit
activate DB
DB --> Repo: RawData
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Data
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service: Calculate & GenerateVietQR(Data)

Service --> Controller: InvoicePreviewDto (Amount, VietQR)
deactivate Service

Controller --> WebPOS: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

WebPOS --> Cashier: Hiển thị màn hình chi tiết tạm tính & VietQR
deactivate WebPOS

Cashier -> WebPOS: Bấm "In phiếu tạm tính"
activate WebPOS

WebPOS -> Controller: POST /api/invoices/\n{tableId}/print-preview
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: PrintPreBill(tableId)
activate Service

Service -> Printer: PrintReceipt(previewDto)
activate Printer
Printer --> Service: OK
deactivate Printer

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> WebPOS: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

WebPOS --> Cashier: Thông báo đã in thành công
deactivate WebPOS

Cashier -> Waitstaff: Kẹp phiếu tạm tính vào sổ da
Waitstaff -> Waitstaff: Trình sổ da gửi khách đối soát tại bàn

== Kịch bản 2: Thu ngân xác nhận thanh toán & Đóng đơn ==

Cashier -> WebPOS: Chọn bàn, hình thức (Cash/Transfer/Card) & Xác nhận
activate WebPOS

WebPOS -> Controller: POST /api/invoices/{tableId}/settle
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: SettleInvoice(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: SaveInvoice & CompleteTableSession(dto)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: INSERT Invoices\nUPDATE Orders SET Status = 'Paid'\nUPDATE Tables SET Status = 'Available'
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Saved
deactivate Repo

Service -> Printer: PrintOfficialReceipt(invoice)
activate Printer
Printer --> Service: OK
deactivate Printer

Service -> WebPOS: PushSignalR("Table_Available")

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> WebPOS: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

WebPOS --> Cashier: Thanh toán thành công
deactivate WebPOS

Cashier -> Waitstaff: Giao sổ da kèm hóa đơn chính thức
Waitstaff -> Waitstaff: Trình sổ da gửi khách tại bàn

@enduml